<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About Us - Nepal Eco Tours | Experience Nepal's Wild Side</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/activities.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #333;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(44, 85, 48, 0.95) 0%, rgba(74, 124, 89, 0.95) 100%), url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 600"><rect fill="%23f8f9fa" width="1200" height="600"/><circle fill="%23e9ecef" cx="300" cy="150" r="100" opacity="0.3"/><circle fill="%23dee2e6" cx="900" cy="450" r="150" opacity="0.2"/></svg>');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 120px 0 80px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero-content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo-about-us {
            max-width: 150px;
            height: auto;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        /* Rest of your existing CSS remains the same */
        .about-section {
            padding: 80px 0;
        }

        .about-section:nth-child(even) {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fffe 0%, #f1f8f6 100%);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 30px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #2c5530;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            position: relative;
        }


        .section-subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        .content-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .content-text h3 {
            color: #2c5530;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
            position: relative;
        }

        .content-text h3::before {
            content: '';
            width: 40px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #2c5530;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 0;
        }

        .content-text p {
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .content-text strong {
            color: #2c5530;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c5530 0%, #4a7c59 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(44, 85, 48, 0.15);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .highlight-box::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            right: -50%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
        }

        .highlight-box h3 {
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .highlight-box p {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .stats-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin: 60px 0;
        }

        .stat-card {
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }

        .stat-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #2c5530;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .stat-label {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .credentials-content {
            background: white;
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .credentials-content p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .ethics-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .ethics-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .ethics-item i {
            color: #2c5530;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .ethics-item span {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #444;
        }

        .cta {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c5530 0%, #4a7c59 100%);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 0;
        }

        .cta h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .cta p {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .cta-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 18px 40px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .btn-large {
            background: white;
            color: #2c5530;
        }

        .btn-large:hover {
            background: transparent;
            color: white;
            border-color: white;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            color: white;
            border-color: white;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: white;
            color: #2c5530;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }

            .content-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 40px;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }

            .stats-container {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                gap: 20px;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 0 20px;
            }

            .about-section {
                padding: 60px 0;
            }

            .highlight-box {
                padding: 30px;
            }

            .credentials-content {
                padding: 30px;
            }

            .cta-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .logo-about-us {
                max-width: 150px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .stats-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 80px 0 60px;
            }

            .logo-about-us {
                max-width: 120px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-content">
        <div class="logo-aboutus-container">
            <img src="../site-images/logo.png" alt="WildLife Safari Logo" class="logo-about-us">
        </div>
        <h1>About Us</h1>
        <p>Explore Nature. Empower Communities. Conserve the Future.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">WildLife Safari</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">A trusted and well-established adventure travel company in Chitwan National Park</p>

        <div class="content-grid">
            <div class="content-text">
                <h3>Our Story</h3>
                <p><strong>WildLife Safari</strong> is a leading nature and adventure company based in the stunning natural landscape of <strong>Chitwan National Park, Nepal</strong>. Founded in 2017 by experienced and passionate nature guides <strong>Suman Lamsal</strong> and <strong>Sudhan Lamsal</strong>, our mission is to create meaningful travel experiences that blend eco-tourism, conservation, and community engagement.</p>

                <p>Since our inception, we have grown steadily to become a respected name in responsible tourism, known for our commitment to quality service, ethical practices, and environmental stewardship.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="highlight-box">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-leaf"></i> Our Mission</h3>
                <p>To create meaningful travel experiences that blend eco-tourism, conservation, and community engagement while showcasing the natural beauty and cultural richness of Chitwan and its surrounding areas.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Vision</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Redefining what it means to travel with purpose</p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
            <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;">
                Our vision is to be a model for responsible and regenerative tourism in Nepal, where every guest not only explores but contributes positively to the places they visit. We aim to inspire travelers to see nature not just as a destination, but as a cause worth protecting. By integrating adventure, education, and activism, we are redefining what it means to travel with purpose.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Credentials & Expertise</h2>

        <div class="stats-container">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <span class="stat-number">2017</span>
                <div class="stat-label">Founded</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <span class="stat-number">1K+</span>
                <div class="stat-label">Clients</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <span class="stat-number">10%</span>
                <div class="stat-label">Income to Conservation</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <span class="stat-number">100%</span>
                <div class="stat-label">Ethical Tourism</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content-text">
            <p>We are a <strong>fully licensed and government-authorized tour operator</strong>, recognized by both the Government of Nepal and the Chitwan National Park Authority. All of our activities are operated with the highest safety and ethical standards.</p>

            <p>Our team consists of <strong>certified, professional, and multilingual nature guides</strong> who bring in-depth knowledge of Nepal's rich biodiversity, culture, and ecosystems. A nationally recognized conservation leader guides and mentors our team, helping us stay aligned with modern conservation approaches and sustainable travel principles.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Ethical Approach</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Respect for wildlife and ecosystems they inhabit</p>

        <div class="content-text">
            <p>We strictly avoid any form of wildlife exploitation, including tourism activities involving elephants in captivity, or any close interactions with rhinos, tigers, and vultures that go against their natural behavior. Our philosophy is rooted in respect for wildlife and the ecosystems they inhabit.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ethics-list">
            <div class="ethics-item">
                <i class="fas fa-ban"></i>
                <span>No elephant rides or captive wildlife exploitation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ethics-item">
                <i class="fas fa-eye"></i>
                <span>Safe and respectful wildlife observation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ethics-item">
                <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                <span>Respect for natural animal behavior</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ethics-item">
                <i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
                <span>Low-impact tourism practices</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="cta">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Ready for Your Adventure?</h2>
        <p>Book your jungle experience today and create memories that will last a lifetime.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
            <a href="/booking" class="btn btn-large">Book Now</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-large btn-outline">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>